  "body": "In the hurry and excitement of the last two days, it seems the blog post about the Riemannan hypothesis has been mistakenly attributed to “the Lean and Mathlib communities”. Clearly such an attribution would at least require a discussion among Mathlib maintainers and reviewers on the Mathlib side. Pending such a discussion, I propose a more factual attribution (assuming the actual authors of that post wish to remain anonymous).",
